onger allows com.android.library + kotlin.multiplatform in one\n  subproject. The hierarchy template matches the AGP target explicitly\n  because KGP's withAndroidTarget() only matches its own androidTarget(),\n  which silently dropped materialMain from the Android compilation\n- sample:android uses AGP's built-in Kotlin and moves to minSdk 24 because\n  JetBrains navigation 2.10 requires it; calf-navigation keeps androidx\n  navigation 2.9.7 so the library stays at minSdk 23\n- Web targets: only modules with browser-run tests bundle test executables\n  (CMP-4906); the CMP check is skipped for targets without test sources\n- CI runs on macos-26: CMP 1.11+ needs Xcode 26 to link ui-uikit, which is\n  why main is red on macos-14\n- Drop deprecated gradle.properties flags and `by registering` task DSL\n- kotlinx-datetime 0.8.0, Coil 3.6.2, Ktor 3.5.2, Vanniktech 0.37.0,\n  kyant backdrop 2.0.1 / shapes 1.2.1, appcompat 1.8.0, androidx compose 1.12.1\n- Document that Compose 1.12 requires compileSdk 37 for Android consumers","parents":[{"sha":"21a08e6fed7206413cb3bf7b163f4b29ec8ee128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/21a08e6fed7206413cb3bf7b163f4b29ec8ee128","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/21a08e6fed7206413cb3bf7b163f4b29ec8ee128"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"c1ec88501fb42d76ae32103daa5ed9e29d07b66d","node_id":"C_kwDOKDql7toAKGMxZWM4ODUwMWZiNDJkNzZhZTMyMTAzZGFhNWVkOWUyOWQwN2I2NmQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/c1ec88501fb42d76ae32103daa5ed9e29d07b66d","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/c1ec88501fb42d76ae32103daa5ed9e29d07b66d","author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-13T09:26:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"